{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00320","headline":"九月十日偶书 · 後主煜","name":"九月十日偶书","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"晚雨秋阴酒乍醒，感时心绪杳难平。\n黄花冷落不成艳，红叶飕飀竞鼓声。\n背世返能厌俗态，偶缘犹未忘多情。\n自从双鬓斑斑白，不学安仁却自惊。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"後主煜","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00320.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00320","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}